    493  f8f8							; ==========================================================================
    494  f8f8							; C11 (2026-10-21): HOT DEATH IS DERIVED FROM THE PF BUFFERS.
    495  f8f8							; convert promotes EVERY row-1 wall cell of a mid_band_type=1 model, so a
    496  f8f8							; hot shape's hot cells ARE its solid row-1 PF cells; the C4 bomb punch
    497  f8f8							; clears PF0Buf cells, so a blasted (thin) parent cell stops being hot with
    498  f8f8							; no record stream and no parent gate. Hot cells never exist on rows 0/2.
    499  f8f8							; The per-shape 5 B/record stream is gone (LEVEL_FORMAT 6); MetaB b6 —
    500  f8f8							; staged at room load — gates the sweep so only hot rooms pay for it.
    501  f8f8							; ==========================================================================
    502  f8f8		       a5 9a		      lda	RoomMetaB
    503  f8fa		       29 40		      and	#$40	; b6 = mid_band_type hot
