   1169  fd38							; --- NUSIZ1 owned here since P2b (kernel's VBL $30 restore deleted) ---
   1170  fd38							; Constant $30 (P1 single, M1 8 clk): the door distinction is COLOR
   1171  fd38							; (yellow $1C staged below), not width — the 4clk block read as "half
   1172  fd38							; a tile", the 2clk thin stripe as "only one strip" (user, 2026-10-12).
