   1338  ff69							; ---------------- $82 hcrunch: band row from the record, fixed 10-cell prefix
   1339  ff69							; The record's band byte is the crunch row: 1 (band 2) or 2 (band 3), chosen
   1340  ff69							; by the generator from how the player first enters the room (user
   1341  ff69							; 2026-10-28). Prefix = always 10 cells (record x/w/h ignored). ALWAYS HOT
   1342  ff69							; from the SIDES: any overlap of the player box with the covered prefix
   1343  ff69							; kills, at any phase/extent. A VERTICAL touch is a plain wall: the feet
   1344  ff69							; reach the band's first line (landing on it) or the head its last line
   1345  ff69							; (bumping it from below). The walk steps 1 px at a time, so the first
   1346  ff69							; overlapping pixel is exact. A hot room's band 2 never gets here: the hot
   1347  ff69							; sweep in HotOverlapBody already killed.
